  <title
     id="encoder-decoder-title">Learnable Denoising Sparse Wavelet Network</title>
  <desc
     id="encoder-decoder-desc">The Encoding Block splits an activation across convolution and downsampling paths, while the Decoding Block upsamples two inputs, applies transposed convolutions, and sums the results.</desc>
